description: The lockfile is a derived artefact, so every dependency update, security floor, version hold and override must survive the lockfile being fully deleted and rebuilt. Constraints live in package.json ranges and pnpm-workspace.yaml overrides, never in recorded lockfile state. Run the rebuild and assert floors, holds, audit and frozen install; do not reason about it.
alwaysApply: true
